# ----- droplet_work: LIVE backend source + 30+ backup/secret-risk files.
#       Curation (git mv the deployable .py into backend/) is DEFERRED to a later
#       P1-coordinated unit (serializes on caller.py). Until then, keep the dir on
#       disk as local scratch but do NOT track it (spec §4.1 option b). This also
#       keeps the *.bak/*.w3bak backups and the cleanup.sql false-positive out of git.
droplet_work/
droplet_work/**

